  "body_html": "<h1>mechanism_isDSIC</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem mechanism_isDSIC : mechanism.isDSIC (fun (w : I) (pay : I → U) (vals : I → U) (i : I) =&gt; if i = w then vals i - pay i else 0)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsDSIC</li>\n<li>isDSIC</li>\n<li>truthful_weakly_dominant</li>\n<li>game_eq_toStrategicGame</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>IsDSIC</li>\n<li>isDSIC</li>\n<li>truthful_weakly_dominant</li>\n<li>game_eq_toStrategicGame</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
